      "@type": "File",
      "contentSize": "2868",
      "description": "Shell script that re-runs the exact pipeline that produced this dataset: clones the source repo at the recorded commit, builds rat_enum, and runs the original CLI invocation(s). Run as `bash tools/reproduce.sh`. Honours REPO, COMMIT, SRC_DIR env vars for offline / pre-cloned scenarios; honours SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH for bit-identical metadata.",
