      "description": "Standalone, dependency-free Python 3 script that checks every sha256 recorded in ro-crate-metadata.json against the on-disk file bytes, flags any file on disk not in the manifest, and reports the producing-tool commit. Run as `python3 tools/verify_sha256.py`; add `--strict` to also fail on non-pristine provenance (`-dirty`/`unknown`). Exits 0 on full match, 1 on mismatch.",
